title: MSSQL OLE Automation Procedure Abuse
id: 0078ec12-c9ed-4b50-9aaa-2961fe0f4a68
status: experimental
description: Detects use of SQL Server OLE automation procedures (sp_OACreate, sp_OAMethod) in queries, which instantiate COM objects to run commands or write files, an alternative to xp_cmdshell for code execution.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/
logsource:
  category: application
  product: mssql
detection:
  selection:
    query_text|contains:
      - 'sp_OACreate'
      - 'sp_OAMethod'
      - 'Ole Automation Procedures'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query_text
  - user_name
  - client_ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate OLE automation usage
level: high
tags:
  - attack.execution
  - attack.t1059
